# Mosquitto ACL for Loftie local control.
#
# Usernames are the client-cert CNs (mosquitto.conf: use_identity_as_username),
# issued by ../gen_certs.py. Once an acl_file is set, anything not granted here
# is denied, so a cert signed by your CA but not listed below gets no topics.
#
# The firmware applies any JSON on /config or /commands/# -- including otaURL
# (unsigned remote firmware install, see docs/security-gaps.md C1). Only the
# home-assistant identity may publish there; the clock may not command itself.

# The clock: reads its config/command topics, publishes telemetry.
user AlarmClock
topic read /devices/+/config
topic read /devices/+/commands/#
topic write /devices/+/state

# Home Assistant: reads telemetry, sends config/commands.
# homeassistant/# covers HA's own birth/status messages.
user home-assistant
topic read /devices/+/state
topic write /devices/+/config
topic write /devices/+/commands/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
